## 6. Structural Summary

### Overall Architecture

Wikidata's RDF graph is organized around a **reified statement model** with four main layers:

```
Item (e.g., wd:Q42)
  ├── prop/direct/P*     →  Direct/simplified value (item or literal)
  ├── prop/P*            →  Statement node (reified claim)
  │     ├── prop/statement/P*  →  Statement value
  │     ├── prop/qualifier/P*  →  Qualifier value
  │     ├── wikiba.se/ontology#rank  →  Rank (Normal/Preferred/Deprecated)
  │     └── prov#wasDerivedFrom  →  Reference node
  │           └── prop/reference/P*  →  Reference value
  ├── schema:description →  Multilingual description literals
  ├── rdfs:label         →  Multilingual label literals
  └── skos:altLabel      →  Alternative label literals
```

### Value Node Types

Complex values (quantities, coordinates, timestamps) are stored in dedicated value nodes:

| Value Type | Internal Properties | Count |
|---|---|---|
| **QuantityValue** | `quantityAmount`, `quantityUnit`, `quantityLowerBound`, `quantityUpperBound`, `quantityNormalized` | 57.5M |
| **GlobecoordinateValue** | `geoLatitude`, `geoLongitude`, `geoPrecision`, `geoGlobe` | 12.4M |
| **TimeValue** | `timeValue`, `timePrecision`, `timeCalendarModel`, `timeTimezone` | 423K |

### Lexicographic Layer

A parallel subgraph for lexicographic data:

```
Lexeme (e.g., wd:L1)
  ├── lemma              →  Lemma string (possibly in multiple scripts)
  ├── lexicalCategory    →  Part-of-speech (Q1084, etc.)
  ├── dc:language        →  Language entity
  ├── lemon:lexicalForm  →  Form node
  │     ├── grammaticalFeature  →  Grammar tags (Q110786, etc.)
  │     └── representation      →  Surface form string
  └── lemon:sense        →  Sense node
        ├── skos:definition     →  Gloss/definition
        └── prop/direct/P5137   →  Item for this sense
```

### Sitelink Layer

Each Wikimedia page is represented as an Article entity:

```
Article (e.g., https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Douglas_Adams)
  ├── schema:about       →  Wikidata item (wd:Q42)
  ├── schema:inLanguage  →  Language code ("en")
  ├── schema:isPartOf    →  Wiki site URL
  └── schema:name        →  Page title
```

### Scale

| Metric | Value |
|---|---|
| Total typed entities (rdf:type) | ~1.95B |
| Unique entity types observed | 120+ (plus thousands of no-value classes) |
| Unique properties | 100+ ontology-level + ~13,568 Wikidata properties (each with direct, statement, qualifier, reference, value, and normalized variants) |
| Largest single predicate | `schema:description` (3.35B triples) |
| Most common direct property | `prop/direct/P31` (instance of) — 124M uses |

